Attribution: this commit also carries work it does not describe.

Besides the icon sweep in its message, it contains the informed-consent sheet
for the treatment plan - bot/app/modules/patients/plan_acord.py and
tests/test_plan_acord.py, plus the link in the plan card header and the
plan_acord event in the patient's activity log. That is a separate feature by
Oleg (art. 13 Legea nr. 263/2005), written in parallel; it landed in the working
tree between two commits of the icon work and was swept in by `git add -A`.

It is recorded here rather than fixed by rewriting history: this commit is an
ancestor of f1176c2, which tag v1.19.15 points at and which the published binary
was built from. Rebasing would have left that tag on a commit outside the branch
- the exact failure the project's release rules exist to prevent - and would have
required deleting and recreating a tag a live release depends on.

The feature itself is described in the v1.19.15 tag message.
